  "instructions": "ELVSUM-D3. Open the declarator.org person page (Evidence) and check the row, then answer three questions: dates right? (the years are DECLARATION years: the first and last year the person is listed in this post; the end is a floor, not the departure date; judge whether those years are what the declarations show) / person right? (this is the person who held the post; if the card says the row was linked to someone already in the database, check that link too) / post right? (is it really this post and level: deputy governor / minister / head of an executive body of the region, NOT a deputy minister, a division inside an apparatus, or a municipal post). Use 'unsure' when the page does not settle it.",
